# .trivyignore — suppress specific CVEs by ID with an expiry.
# Format:  CVE-YYYY-NNNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD  # reason
# The `exp:` metadata is a Trivy 0.46+ feature; older versions just ignore
# the line up to the # and the suppression is permanent (avoid — always
# put a review date).
#
# Add entries ONLY with:
#   - a link to the upstream fix or tracking issue
#   - an expiry date (max 90 days from today)
#   - the owner's name
#
# Example (uncomment and edit if a legitimate suppression is needed):
# CVE-2026-54283 exp:2026-11-30  # starlette form-limit DoS; tracked in FastAPI upgrade; owner: vyankatesh
